Based on the search results, the most recent Volkswagen Tiguan Allspace TDI is part of the facelifted model range (2021-Present in some markets, including 2023/2024 in the UK/Europe). The TDI engine options are primarily the 2.0-litre with outputs of 150 PS (148 hp) and 200 PS (197 hp) (Source 3, 5, 15, 16, 17, 18, 20, 22, 24, 30, 32, 33, 37). These are typically paired with a 7-speed DSG automatic gearbox, and available with FWD or 4MOTION AWD (Source 3, 5, 8, 15, 16, 18, 20, 22, 30, 37).

Here's the evaluation based on the findings for the most recent Tiguan Allspace TDI models:

